Description: Koko's per-file 3D entries are the stereo layer's menu and store (ORDER 551b)
 For a local picture the 3D menu shows the layer's QML menu (Stereo.FileChoiceMenu), and the choices (the input packing,
 Not 3D, the swap) are kept in the layer's per-file store, which Dolphin, the thumbnailers and Gwenview read; the page keeps
 which eye is shown. The file is not written unless the person chooses the layer's save.
 Needs libstereo-layer-dev (>= 1.19.0).
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-14
